{"id":"39300d7f70b4beea","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-realizability-environment-locality.md","title":"数实现性的自由参数局部性","display":"lem-realizability-environment-locality — 数实现性的自由参数局部性","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-realizability-environment-locality","aliases":["72-lem-realizability-environment-locality"],"display":"lem-realizability-environment-locality — 数实现性的自由参数局部性","depends_on":["[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]","[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]","[[72-df-number-realizability-with-truth]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §1.6 Substitution Property, print413/PDF425; explicit local environment-version proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-realizability-environment-locality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-realizability-environment-locality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-realizability-environment-locality — 数实现性的自由参数局部性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ce276183c963d6c\" href=\"?note=2ce276183c963d6c\" title=\"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth\">72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e39710a1818d0447\" href=\"?note=e39710a1818d0447\" title=\"72-df-number-realizability-with-truth\">72-df-number-realizability-with-truth</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §1.6 Substitution Property, print413/PDF425; explicit local environment-version proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal A_a\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta,\\zeta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\eta,\\zeta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>，且二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)\\)</span> 上相同。所有 NR、NRT 使用同一编号、同一数值配对。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\zeta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\zeta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A,\\eta)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A,\\zeta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\zeta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\zeta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A,\\eta)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A,\\zeta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先对项证明求值只读自由变量。再依次对 AT、NR、NRT 作公式归纳；量词子句在两环境的同一坐标更新同一个 m，使矩阵的自由坐标仍一致。蕴涵对子公式的每个输入实现者使用归纳假设；NRT 的附加真值分量使用先已证明的 AT 局部性。该引理不允许在两个不同的计算编号或配对结构之间直接比较实现性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","status":"resolved","id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth","status":"resolved","id":"2ce276183c963d6c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-arithmetic-standard-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-number-realizability-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"e39710a1818d0447","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-number-realizability-with-truth]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal A_a","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta,\\zeta\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fv}_a(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\eta)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{AT}(A,\\zeta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\eta)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{NR}(n,A,\\zeta),\\qquad\n\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A,\\eta)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathsf{NRT}(n,A,\\zeta).","display":true}],"bytes":1754,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-75","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simulta